@startuml
title Activity Diagram: Rating & Review
skinparam style strictuml

|User (Buyer/Seller)|
start
:Go to "Transaction History";
:Select Completed Order;
:Click "Rate User";

|System|
:Check if Rated before?;
if (Already Rated?) then (Yes)
    :Show "You have already rated";
    stop
else (No)
    |User (Buyer/Seller)|
    :Select Star Rating (1-5);
    :Write Comment;
    :Submit Review;
    
    |System|
    :Validate Content (No bad words);
    
    |System|
    :Save Review;
    :Recalculate Average Rating \nfor Target User;
    :Update User Trust Score;
    
    |System|
    :Notify Target User;
    stop
endif
@enduml